WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Cold lists get called blind.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.800
No research, no reason, no idea why anyone would buy. Leads researched: zero.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Know why they'd buy before you call.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
A Gemini agent researches each business, scores fit, and cites something specific in the first line.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
The row updates. A human sends.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
Research, score and draft go back to the same Notion row, marked Enriched. The email waits as a draft.
